/a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,I\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,I\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6IdealOnSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6IdealOnSet}_S\\)</span> (see the dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IPositive}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IPositive}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IPartition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IPartition}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IRefines}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IRefines}_S\\)</span> (auxiliary predicates defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8PrecipitousIdealCardinal}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8PrecipitousIdealCardinal}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}positive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IPositive}_S(A,\\kappa,I)\n\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\kappa\\land A\\notin I.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}positive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IPositive}_S(A,\\kappa,I)\n\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\kappa\\land A\\notin I.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}partition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IPartition}_S(W,S,\\kappa,I)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{IPositive}_S(S,\\kappa,I)\n\\land W\\subseteq\\mathcal P(S)\n\\land\\forall A\\in W\\;\\mathrm{IPositive}_S(A,\\kappa,I)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall A,B\\in W\\;(A\\neq B\\to A\\cap B\\in I)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall B\\subseteq S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{IPositive}_S(B,\\kappa,I)\\to\n\\exists A\\in W\\;\\mathrm{IPositive}_S(A\\cap B,\\kappa,I)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}partition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IPartition}_S(W,S,\\kappa,I)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{IPositive}_S(S,\\kappa,I)\n\\land W\\subseteq\\mathcal P(S)\n\\land\\forall A\\in W\\;\\mathrm{IPositive}_S(A,\\kappa,I)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall A,B\\in W\\;(A\\neq B\\to A\\cap B\\in I)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall B\\subseteq S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{IPositive}_S(B,\\kappa,I)\\to\n\\exists A\\in W\\;\\mathrm{IPositive}_S(A\\cap B,\\kappa,I)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}partition\\text{-}refinement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IRefines}_S(W&#39;,W)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall A&#39;\\in W&#39;\\;\\exists A\\in W\\;(A&#39;\\subseteq A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}partition\\text{-}refinement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{IRefines}_S(W&#39;,W)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall A&#39;\\in W&#39;\\;\\exists A\\in W\\;(A&#39;\\subseteq A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}precipitous\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8PrecipitousIdealCardinal}_S(\\kappa,I)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6IdealOnSet}_S(\\kappa,I)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall S\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\Biggl(\n\\mathrm{IPositive}_S(S,\\kappa,I)\\to\n\\forall\\vec W\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec W,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{IPartition}_S(\\vec W(n),S,\\kappa,I)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{IRefines}_S(\\vec W(n+1),\\vec W(n))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\\exists\\vec A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\vec A(n)\\in\\vec W(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n(\\vec A(n+1)\\subseteq\\vec A(n))\n\\land\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec A(n)\\neq\\varnothing\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\Biggr]\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}precipitous\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8PrecipitousIdealCardinal}_S(\\kappa,I)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6IdealOnSet}_S(\\kappa,I)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall S\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\Biggl(\n\\mathrm{IPositive}_S(S,\\kappa,I)\\to\n\\forall\\vec W\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec W,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{IPartition}_S(\\vec W(n),S,\\kappa,I)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{IRefines}_S(\\vec W(n+1),\\vec W(n))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\\exists\\vec A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\vec A(n)\\in\\vec W(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n(\\vec A(n+1)\\subseteq\\vec A(n))\n\\land\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec A(n)\\neq\\varnothing\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\Biggr]\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the standard descending-partition characterization of precipitousness. It is equivalent to well-foundedness of the generic ultrapower but stays entirely at the set level.</li>\n<li>The former formula passed the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> to set-coded forcing and ultrapower interfaces and left the check-name and forcing parameters implicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-ideal6-ideal-on-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"57e0cc0c038bbcc0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-ideal6-ideal-on-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6IdealOnSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IPositive}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IPartition}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IRefines}_S","display":false},{